	<application id="com.wilderguard.game.beta">
		<id>com.wilderguard.game.beta</id>
		<added>2026-10-31</added>
		<lastupdated>2026-11-06</lastupdated>
		<name>Wilderguard Beta</name>
		<summary>Eric's tower defense adventure</summary>
		<desc>Made by Eric, a 7-year-old boy.

Defend Elderglen across five regions and 25 monster waves. Build Archer,
Cannon, and Frost towers, upgrade your defenses, and earn diamonds and spells.
Send soldiers from towers, train them separately and recover diamonds for
each survivor. Defend five distinct pixel-photo environments and roads.
Confirm purchases and play offline with compact landscape touch controls.
Watch castle and tower health, repair damaged towers and counter ranged
axe-throwing orcs with soldiers. Fullscreen controls adapt to your device.

Frost towers prefer unchilled enemies. Chill chance improves from 35% at
level 1 to 50% at level 2 and 85% at level 3.

Every tower pad has useful road coverage, including central Frostfall Pass.

This is an early beta in a developer-operated custom F-Droid repository.
There are no accounts, advertising, tracking, or in-app purchases.
Saved progress stays on the device. The beta installs separately from the
original debug preview and does not import that preview's saved progress.
</desc>
